{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33940","headline":"早春以橘子寄鲁望 · 皮日休","name":"早春以橘子寄鲁望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"个个和枝叶捧鲜，彩凝犹带洞庭烟。\n不爲韩嫣金丸重，直是周王玉果圆。\n剖似日魂初破後，弄如星髓未销前。\n知君多病仍中圣，尽送寒苞向枕边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33940.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33940","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}